        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-09T20:34:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>But seriously.</p><p>Voss and Akash Promos would rule.</p><p>PW promos even more so.</p><p>I'm still holding out hope for Headbanging Argent Adept in his 1980's leather pants and rock hair. &nbsp;Rocking out on Xu's Bell.</p><p><span>I want that Argent Adept. &nbsp;He and the other Prime Wardens would fly around in a UFO guitar powered by rock and roll, populating new planets where everyone would just rock forever. &nbsp;The Multiverse would be all, \"Go Prime Wardens, thanks for rocking.\"</span></p>",
