        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/b/a587f6/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2014-07-10T08:39:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Admittedly, I find the suggestion of Prime Warden promos very appealing, especially if they are released along with a mini-expansion (potentially Guise) to provide people outside of North America with a more affordable option to acquire the promos (as &gt;G wonderfully orchestrated last December with the Dark Watch promo set and the replacement cards).</p>",
